  "build": "All four trainer-specific extensions used the release C++17 arm64 flags (-O3 -DNDEBUG -mcpu=apple-m1), the same DuckDB 2.0.1 headers and Homebrew libduckdb_static.a, and no vendor backends. The stock CLI loaded one such extension per fit.",
